  "description": "Barbados employer payroll for 2026, PAYE and National Insurance. Gives the private sector NIS rates (employee 11.00%, employer 12.75% of insurable earnings), the 2026 ceiling of BBD 5,360 a month or BBD 1,238 a week, the Resilience and Regeneration Fund of 0.25% each on gross earnings, PAYE after the BBD 25,000 allowance with tax codes (2026 band rates held as not yet confirmed), and remittance by the 15th of the following month. Trigger on Barbados payroll, PAYE Barbados, NIS Barbados, NISSS, Resilience and Regeneration Fund. Built from BRA and NIS pages; not reviewed by an accountant.",
